{
  "name": "Clasificador IA de Soporte (Reto - Formulario)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Soporte - Nueva solicitud",
        "formDescription": "Describe tu problema. Usa solo datos ficticios.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "ticket",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n-form",
      "name": "Formulario de soporte",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "clasificador-ia-soporte"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "n-ticket-0",
              "name": "ticket",
              "value": "={{ $json.ticket }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n-ticket",
      "name": "Edit Fields (ticket)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analiza la siguiente solicitud de soporte:\n\n{{ $json.ticket }}\n\nDebes:\n- identificar una categoría;\n- asignar prioridad alta, media o baja;\n- escribir un resumen de máximo 25 palabras;\n- proponer una respuesta breve y profesional.\n\nReglas de prioridad:\n- alta: cobros duplicados, fraude, seguridad, pérdida de dinero\n  o servicio completamente bloqueado;\n- media: problema funcional importante pero no crítico;\n- baja: consulta general, información o mejora.\n\n- No inventes información que no aparece en el ticket.",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "n-chain",
      "name": "Basic LLM Chain",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-2.5-flash",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0
        }
      },
      "id": "n-model",
      "name": "Google Gemini Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"categoria\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"prioridad\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"alta\",\n        \"media\",\n        \"baja\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"resumen\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"respuesta_sugerida\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"categoria\",\n    \"prioridad\",\n    \"resumen\",\n    \"respuesta_sugerida\"\n  ]\n}"
      },
      "id": "n-parser",
      "name": "Structured Output Parser",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        600,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "c-alta",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.output.prioridad }}",
                    "rightValue": "alta",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "ALTA"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "MEDIA / BAJA"
        }
      },
      "id": "n-switch",
      "name": "Switch (prioridad)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "n-alta-0",
              "name": "accion",
              "value": "ESCALAR A HUMANO",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "n-alta-1",
              "name": "motivo",
              "value": "Ticket de alta prioridad detectado por IA",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n-alta",
      "name": "Escalar a humano",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1060,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "n-normal-0",
              "name": "accion",
              "value": "RESPUESTA NORMAL",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "n-normal-1",
              "name": "motivo",
              "value": "El ticket puede continuar por el flujo estándar",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "n-normal",
      "name": "Respuesta normal",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1060,
        120
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
